OL,3,GNEWSABodybuilder dies after collapsing
OL,4,Aon stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 33-year-old bodybuilder has died
OL,7,Fafter collapsing on stage during a
OL,8,Fcompetition in Telford.
OL,10,FMateusz Chmura, from Wakefield, became
OL,11,Funwell while competing at the Physical
OL,12,FCulture Association (PCA) British
OL,13,Ffinals at the Telford International
OL,14,FCentre on Sunday.
OL,16,FParamedics were called to the event and
OL,17,FChmura was taken to hospital, where he
OL,18,Flater died. The PCA said the cause of
OL,19,Fhis death had not yet been established.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
